# Keep the image small and never bake secrets/data into it.
#
# Patterns match from the build-context ROOT only: `*.db` does NOT match
# `data/unified_monitor.db`. So the compose data volume (./data: the DB, its
# 15 startup backups, logs, config.json with credentials) must be excluded by
# name, and the file patterns need `**/` to reach any depth. Without this every
# `docker compose up --build` copied the whole live dataset into the image
# layer AND the build cache.
data/
**/backups/
**/storm_frames/
**/opsum_images/
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.log
**/config.json
**/pager_debug.html
**/opsum_debug_*
.venv/
dist/
build/
backups/
storm_frames/
opsum_images/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.log
config.json
.env
power_debug.html
.git/
tests/
pytest.ini
requirements-dev.txt
